-- title:
--   Lemma strategy_value of the MIP* = RE formalization
-- statement:
--   A statement of the module `MIPRE.Foundations.Introspection.SourcePadding` of the MIP\* = RE formalization (commit `70cbf1c` of vidick/MIPRE-formalization). Padding the original CL source game without changing its strategy. Unused seed coordinates are ignored. On every sampled padded question pair, the pulled-back questions have one common original seed. This suffices to preserve perfect PCC play with exactly the original Hilbert-space dimension.
--
--   **Formal statement.** In Lean, with the scope shown:
--
--   ```lean
